@startuml kairos-fellowship-meeting-attendance-sequence
title Fellowship Meeting Attendance Tracker

actor "Fellowship Leader" as Leader
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Leader -> WebAdmin: Schedule / open Fellowship Meeting
WebAdmin -> API: POST /fellowships/{id}/meetings or GET existing
API -> DB: INSERT or SELECT meeting
DB --> API: meetingId
API --> WebAdmin: 200/201

Leader -> WebAdmin: Mark members present/absent\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /fellowships/meetings/{meetingId}/attendance {entries}
API -> DB: UPSERT FellowshipAttendance
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
